      "published_at": "2026-11-18",
      "note": "Registry change, recorded here because this print's constituent_changes is computed against the print it supersedes (2026-11-18), which already carried it: mistral-small-3.2-24b-deepinfra (Mistral Small 3.2 on DeepInfra's default fp8 endpoint) was admitted on 18 Nov alongside mistral-small-3.2-24b-instruct (Parasail), after Parasail failed most of its requests that morning. Same open weights, different host (fp8 where Parasail serves bf16, at a lower list price). See docs/methodology.md, registry inclusion policy, entry of 2026-11-18. This print weights by model family (rules-2026-11-18): 10 qualifying entries from 9 model families, the two Mistral entries sharing one family weight. The Parasail entry is carried forward from 2026-11-17 under the 3-day rule: in this run its two T2 instances that returned failed the quality gate and its T3 instances returned no run records. Grok 4.6 produced no runs: xAI refused every request because the account's credit or monthly spending limit was used up."
    }
